# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in git.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if lock is not desired, uncomment this:
# lock

# poetry
#   Poetry uses pyproject.toml and poetry.lock. Including poetry.lock in git is recommended.

